e use the rule\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(\\theta )}{{x}^{′}(\\theta )}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the necessary derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(\\theta )=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,{y}^{′}(\\theta )=-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }=-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting into our formula for the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\frac{d}{d\\theta }(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta )}{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,{csc}^{3}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353880 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353881 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353882 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353883 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353884 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1041 "selection" 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353881 13194139535531 true] [17592186353879 1110 #uuid "44de3529-1272-58ca-8521-29909d1699ab" 13194139535531 true] [17592186353880 1034 "\\sqrt{2}\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta " 13194139535531 true] [17592186353880 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535531 true] [17592186353880 1111 #uuid "6e9ef96d-08df-5e6b-abf2-4777e0774cc1" 13194139535531 true] [17592186353881 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,{csc}^{3}⁡\\theta " 13194139535531 true] [17592186353881 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535531 true] [17592186353881 1111 #uuid "dc8ad0f5-17f7-5ae5-871b-d8314801e694" 13194139535531 true] [17592186353882 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}\\,{csc}^{3}⁡\\theta 